# When another program completes one overdue block and adds another, Overdue drops the first and lists the new one.
file <<END
- Aa @due({today-3})
- Bb @due({today-2})
END
keys gO
see - Bb
outside <<END
- Aa @due({today-3}) @done({today})
- Bb @due({today-2})
- Dd @due({today-5})
END
see 5 days ago ·
see - Dd
hide Aa
